---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | Emon Hossain"
  description="Privacy notice for emonhossain.pro, including contact data, hosting logs and third-party links or resources."
>
  <div class="container" style="padding:4rem 1.5rem;max-width:46rem;">
    <div class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:1.875rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--brand-ink);margin-top:1rem;">Privacy Notice</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--brand-stone-400);font-size:.75rem;margin-top:.5rem;">Last updated: 24 August 2026</p>

    <div style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.85;margin-top:2rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;">
      <p>This notice describes the privacy-relevant behavior of emonhossain.pro as currently implemented. If analytics, forms, advertising pixels or other data-processing tools are added later, this notice should be updated before relying on them.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Information you choose to send</h2>
      <p>If you contact Emon by email, the information in your message is used to understand and respond to the inquiry and to continue the conversation where appropriate.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Technical and hosting data</h2>
      <p>Like most websites, hosting and network providers may process technical request information such as IP address, user agent, requested URL, timestamps and security-related logs as part of delivering and protecting the site.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p>The current source does not intentionally present a site analytics consent system or claim that analytics cookies are active. If non-essential analytics or tracking is introduced, the implementation and this notice should be reviewed together.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Third-party resources and links</h2>
      <p>The site may load or link to third-party services, including font delivery and external websites. Those providers may receive normal web-request information and operate under their own privacy terms.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--brand-ink);">Contact</h2>
      <p>For a privacy-related question about this website, email <a href="mailto:contact@emonhossain.pro" style="color:var(--brand-red);">contact@emonhossain.pro</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
